+- **A phase's own spec stays at the phase root as `NN-SPEC.md`, and the supporting designs that fed it go in `refs/` beside it, without the `NN-` prefix.** The folder is deliberately not `specs/`: sitting next to `NN-SPEC.md` that reads as the same thing and invites the question of which is which. The path already names the phase, so repeating it inside only slows the read. A later phase that needs this spec links to it — "on the basis of phase 04's spec" — instead of copying or moving it, and that is what keeps the path stable.
